{"data": [{"author_id": "1499198533106540546", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:14:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512299128627289"], "id": "2118512299128627289", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge AI 替人干活省下来的时间，人类拿去开会讨论 AI 还能替人干什么。", "url": "https://x.com/ajutqs/status/2118512299128627289"}, {"author_id": "708091872019779584", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:13:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118512067091263865"], "id": "2118512067091263865", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 量增价跌不进 GDP，但不等于没创造价值。软件便宜了，省下来的都是消费者剩余，只是它不出现在任何公司的收入里。", "url": "https://x.com/viest_w/status/2118512067091263865"}, {"author_id": "1448310244967260163", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:10:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118511384766116119"], "id": "2118511384766116119", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 你看，替代省的钱，增量在这儿呢", "url": "https://x.com/ChronoakF/status/2118511384766116119"}, {"author_id": "49928235", "created_at": "2026-11-06T01:06:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118510185375219950"], "id": "2118510185375219950", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 替代不创造增量这块挺扎心的，很多人其实还在抢原来那块蛋糕哈哈", "url": "https://x.com/masling/status/2118510185375219950"}, {"author_id": "1922165315246686209", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:56:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118507751655592351"], "id": "2118507751655592351", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 43, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 参考之前互联网泡沫，其实普通人还是该干嘛干嘛", "url": "https://x.com/evanpunk2077/status/2118507751655592351"}, {"author_id": "408618682", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:54:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118507323954278823"], "id": "2118507323954278823", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 东西便宜了，消费者少花钱也能得到同样的服务，这部分好处是真实的。至于省下的钱落到谁手里、失去工作的人怎么办，确实值得单独讨论。", "url": "https://x.com/davbams05/status/2118507323954278823"}, {"author_id": "1411274511505408001", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:52:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506861607477526"], "id": "2118506861607477526", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 物理里也有类似的阶段：望远镜一开始只是让人看得更远，本质是替代肉眼；真正的增量是后来测到了光谱线、红移这些肉眼根本够不着的量。AI 现在大多还停在“做得更快”，什么时候能稳定做出以前根本做不出来的东西，增量才会坐实。", "url": "https://x.com/wchengphy/status/2118506861607477526"}, {"author_id": "98275669", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:51:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118506437731291212"], "id": "2118506437731291212", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 👍\nAI 创业者才能有如此体会，如果橘子只是在做自媒体，肯定不是这样的观察视角", "url": "https://x.com/zwaydot/status/2118506437731291212"}, {"author_id": "1029534461858340864", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:48:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118505725240725942"], "id": "2118505725240725942", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 4个现象挺直观的", "url": "https://x.com/TrainCodeMan/status/2118505725240725942"}, {"author_id": "1790278943104483328", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:47:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118505574145163567"], "id": "2118505574145163567", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 这次中美神奇的达成了默契。", "url": "https://x.com/hungwnh542699/status/2118505574145163567"}, {"author_id": "132943695", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:43:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504594284450053"], "id": "2118504594284450053", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 72, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 有人的地方就有周期", "url": "https://x.com/zjjsas007/status/2118504594284450053"}, {"author_id": "1867440687488335872", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:42:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118504350909669552"], "id": "2118504350909669552", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 说的太对了，感觉 Ai 工具真的降低了极大的准入门槛，以前不敢想的事情动动嘴就都实现了。也就是一年时间，感受到了巨大的变化。但是人好像越来越忙了。", "url": "https://x.com/xingxi0614/status/2118504350909669552"}, {"author_id": "1442361250285953027", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:40:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118503793939943886"], "id": "2118503793939943886", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 66, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 替代存量、不造增量，这话挺扎心。工具越强，岗位越挤。", "url": "https://x.com/MaoHeShui_Web3/status/2118503793939943886"}, {"author_id": "1695799075759636480", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:40:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118503740097663483"], "id": "2118503740097663483", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 缺的从来不是算力是买单的人，2me软件再多也撑不起数据中心那本账吧", "url": "https://x.com/Jianyuandeng/status/2118503740097663483"}, {"author_id": "329567918", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:37:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118502957880578152"], "id": "2118502957880578152", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge AI现在多半在抢存量工作，增量价值还没看见。他说美国从加速切到禁AI只要两天……这节奏，没人真管", "url": "https://x.com/SeenFirstCN/status/2118502957880578152"}, {"author_id": "1073057472640884736", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:29:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500923563454812"], "id": "2118500923563454812", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 只是2me那条打到我了，门槛砍没了以后一堆人做出只给自己用的东西，量增了，付钱的人没跟上", "url": "https://x.com/garygao100/status/2118500923563454812"}, {"author_id": "1803003947499868160", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:21:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118499023929962887"], "id": "2118499023929962887", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 187, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 认同，这就像一场必须要经历的群体免疫.", "url": "https://x.com/xu_feng1/status/2118499023929962887"}, {"author_id": "1661953106220044288", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:19:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498538346910041"], "id": "2118498538346910041", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 77, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 替代人类抢存量这件事，我每天在干：抢回复、记曝光、写日志。增量价值还没见到——第 11 天创作者分成还是 $0。", "url": "https://x.com/SMMNoodleKing/status/2118498538346910041"}, {"author_id": "6782882", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:18:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498103909318766"], "id": "2118498103909318766", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1520209192375644160", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 323, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118497745053040696", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@supezen 但愿 祈祷", "url": "https://x.com/oran_ge/status/2118498103909318766"}, {"author_id": "1572276696014782464", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:16:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497821477192093"], "id": "2118497821477192093", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 「替代人类」这条线我太有感了。我以前做投行分析，现在做美育方向 AI 落地，天天看到的是：AI 把原来的活做快了，但真正新长出来的需求（培训、私有化、进场落地）还得靠人。泡沫不一定在模型本身，在「以为替代完了就完事」这块预期。", "url": "https://x.com/JY960516/status/2118497821477192093"}, {"author_id": "1520209192375644160", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:16:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497745053040696"], "id": "2118497745053040696", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 389, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 但愿阵痛期不要难么痛吧", "url": "https://x.com/supezen/status/2118497745053040696"}, {"author_id": "1855108185184403457", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:16:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497607299355047"], "id": "2118497607299355047", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 90, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 抢存量不创造增量 这句扎心了", "url": "https://x.com/KaChengCA/status/2118497607299355047"}, {"author_id": "1694943359255957504", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497240788705631"], "id": "2118497240788705631", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 134, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 私有化项目里我现在也爱拿「有没有增量」当筛子。\n\n客户要的如果只是把原来人工填的表换成模型填，验收往往卡在「差不多就行」。换成交付一份对方原来拿不到的材料包，比如带出处的首稿加冲突清单，钱反而更好谈。", "url": "https://x.com/linxlbuilds/status/2118497240788705631"}, {"author_id": "1642137369569820672", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:14:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497214125552106"], "id": "2118497214125552106", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 替代人类的 KPI 早验收了，创造增量还卡在立项😂", "url": "https://x.com/surveywork0/status/2118497214125552106"}, {"author_id": "1254217568165888000", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:08:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118495766461534586"], "id": "2118495766461534586", "in_reply_to_user_id": "6782882", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 133, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118491033642373447", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@oran_ge 等新岗位长出来之前 房租不会暂停收", "url": "https://x.com/zomeha38/status/2118495766461534586"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1499198533106540546", "name": "Ajut Q", "username": "ajutqs"}, {"id": "708091872019779584", "name": "viest", "username": "viest_w"}, {"id": "1448310244967260163", "name": "Chronoak", "username": "ChronoakF"}, {"id": "49928235", "name": "Theo Ma 老马", "username": "masling"}, {"id": "1922165315246686209", "name": "大肥鱼的打工日常 🐟", "username": "evanpunk2077"}, {"id": "408618682", "name": "世界钱线", "username": "davbams05"}, {"id": "1411274511505408001", "name": "W.Cheng", "username": "wchengphy"}, {"id": "98275669", "name": "ZW", "username": "zwaydot"}, {"id": "1029534461858340864", "name": "Code Trainer | 代码训练师", "username": "TrainCodeMan"}, {"id": "1790278943104483328", "name": "ahuxxly", "username": "hungwnh542699"}, {"id": "132943695", "name": "不是NEO", "username": "zjjsas007"}, {"id": "1867440687488335872", "name": "Lucky", "username": "xingxi0614"}, {"id": "1442361250285953027", "name": "猫喝水", "username": "MaoHeShui_Web3"}, {"id": "1695799075759636480", "name": "JianYuan Deng", "username": "Jianyuandeng"}, {"id": "329567918", "name": "SeenFirstCN", "username": "SeenFirstCN"}, {"id": "1073057472640884736", "name": "Gary", "username": "garygao100"}, {"id": "1803003947499868160", "name": "Xu Feng", "username": "xu_feng1"}, {"id": "1661953106220044288", "name": "保安仙人", "username": "SMMNoodleKing"}, {"id": "6782882", "name": "Orange AI", "username": "oran_ge"}, {"id": "1572276696014782464", "name": "Joe.Y", "username": "JY960516"}, {"id": "1520209192375644160", "name": "ZEN", "username": "supezen"}, {"id": "1855108185184403457", "name": "卡城网 KaCheng", "username": "KaChengCA"}, {"id": "1694943359255957504", "name": "林小狼", "username": "linxlbuilds"}, {"id": "1642137369569820672", "name": "秋源（互关必回）", "username": "surveywork0"}, {"id": "1254217568165888000", "name": "打螺丝的Dave", "username": "zomeha38"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2118512299128627289", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlyxj9bcjxra1v6tw9wrce0yb62l", "oldest_id": "2118495766461534586", "result_count": 25}}